        "author": "agent",
        "kind": "source",
        "role": "node",
        "tooltip": "Headlines. External vendor.\n\nIt feeds **two** scorers, not one — sentiment, and the momentum read inside technical signals (Dave's, deliberately: it separates a breakout from a knee-jerk to an announcement).\n\nSo a news outage costs two signals, not one. We still ship, and the Digest says so."
