        "tooltip": "**The freshness line.** Anything a source has not delivered by 05:45 is not used; Last-Good stands in and everything downstream of it is marked Stale.\n\nThe run is never held. Missing the open is worse than being slightly stale, and the analyst can see the flag."
       },
       "to": {
        "author": "agent",
        "kind": "control",
        "role": "node",
        "tooltip": "**The freshness line, 05:45.** Fetching starts at 05:30 and retries inside that window; whatever has not arrived by 05:45 is not used for this Run. Last-Good stands in, and everything derived from it is Stale.\n\nThe run is never held — missing the open is worse than being slightly stale.\n\nNote what is *not* behind this gate: the Macro Calendar."
       }
